  steps:
    1. Pick H=3-6, W=3-6. Choose 4 distinct colors (bg, fg1, fg2, sep), none green.
    2. Generate output mask (H x W) with green and bg. Ensure bg count is 2-40% of cells.
    3. Split green cells randomly into two groups (upper_fg_only, lower_fg_only, both).
